                  <p><strong>RE: Request for Reinvestigation under FCRA</strong></p>
                </div>

                <div className="mb-4">
                  <p>Dear Sir/Madam,</p>
                </div>

                <div className="mb-4">
                  <p>I am disputing the accuracy of the following tradelines appearing on my credit report:</p>
